[30.212718, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m▝▜\u001b[48;5;16m█████\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241mHaiku 4.5 · Claude API\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/nonna-app\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst\u001b[9Glook\u001b[14Gat\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gtest\u001b[26Gfile\u001b[31Gto\u001b[34Gunderstand\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gexpected\u001b[58Gbehavior,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gthen\u001b[8Gexamin\u001b[16Gand f\u001b[22Gx the implementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I understand the issue. The current\u001b[43G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[55G\u001b[39muses\u001b[60Gfloor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdivision\u001b[12Gwhich\u001b[18Gdrops\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Gfractional\u001b[39Gpart.\u001b[45GI\u001b[47Gneed\u001b[52Gto\u001b[55Gfix\u001b[59Git\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Ground\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Ghalf up. For exampl\u001b[23G, 7350 ÷ 100 = 73.5, which should round up\u001b[66Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B74.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BLet\u001b[7Gme\u001b[10Gfix\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gimplementation:\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3GBaking… \u001b[38;5;241m(11s · ↓\u001b[20G1.2k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
